{"words": [{"text": "خَـٰلِدِينَ", "translation": "(Will) abide forever"}, {"text": "فِيهَا ۖ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "يُخَفَّفُ", "translation": "will be lightened"}, {"text": "عَنْهُمُ", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابُ", "translation": "the punishment"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "يُنظَرُونَ", "translation": "will be reprieved"}], "sahih": "Abiding eternally therein. The punishment will not be lightened for them, nor will they be reprieved."}